{"parse": {"title": "成你本所是-08", "pageid": 139759, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%88%90%E4%BD%A0%E6%9C%AC%E6%89%80%E6%98%AF-07\" title=\"成你本所是-07\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">成你本所是-08</span><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">成你本所是</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">08</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.A3.8E.E5.BE.80.E4.BD.95.E5.A4.84.E5.8E.BB\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"风往何处去\">风往何处去</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 风往何处去</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Goes a Gentle Wind</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\"><img alt=\"3_0_bg_nongzhuang\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/600px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/900px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d1/Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png/1200px-Cg-3_0_bg_nongzhuang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多沃卡站在焦土的边缘，她绸缎似的长发有些凌乱地披在肩上，风尘仆仆。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的眼睛里盛满了清晰的震惊与尚未平息的忧虑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314623.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314623.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>妈妈！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她从地上弹了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>你怎么来了……不对，你怎么知道我在这儿？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>因为我的术阵被启动了，还因为我是你的妈妈。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多沃卡快步走到女儿身边，用目光检查她身上每一处细微的伤痕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>发生了什么？你受伤了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>确认过女儿无碍后，多沃卡的目光才锐利地投向了偷猎者。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳挺直了肩膀。尽管声音带着劫后余生的颤抖，但却异常明亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>是偷猎者，和当年一样……他们想抓尘酿鹰！但我、我和格林杜尔打败了他们！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她急切地指着水牢术阵弄出的满地狼藉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>格林杜尔保护了我，我启动了你修好的术阵，我又保护了他……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>保护了族群！我没有逃，我面对了他们，我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她深吸一口气，看向母亲的眼睛。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我证明了我可以做到！我……我已经足够勇敢了，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多沃卡静静地听着，没有立刻为女儿的胜利欢呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只是看着女儿亮得惊人的眼睛，看着那张稚气未脱的脸庞，看着她身上混合着血迹和伤痕的模样。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>阿德琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多沃卡轻轻开口，声音不高，却像一颗石子在阿德琳心里激起了一阵困惑的涟漪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>……你为什么要向我证明呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>阿德琳愣住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>那些关于勇敢和胜利的话全都堵在了喉咙里。她眨了眨眼，似乎没听懂母亲的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我……因为……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>你守护了鸟巢的秘密，守护了格林杜尔和这些小家伙，甚至启动了我的术阵……要知道，我在你这个年纪，连木柴都点不着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多沃卡慢慢说着，试图让每个字都清晰而郑重。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>这很了不起，远超妈妈对你的期待。但是，阿德琳……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她停顿了一下，直视着女儿茫然的双眼，想要望进她灵魂深处那个一直紧绷的角落。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>你向我证明“勇敢”做什么呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我没能保护爸爸，没能顺利和格林杜尔缔结契约，你却从不因此责备我，或要求我做任何事……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我以为……是我让你失望了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>不……阿德琳。我只是想，我一个人就可以替缇威尔家处理好所有仇怨。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>你的爸爸，还有更多的人已经不再能前进。但只要我揽下这一切，至少你的人生能够不被噩梦绑架。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>我从来没想过，你竟然是这么想的……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音里没有责备，只有深深的不解与一种近乎悲伤的怜爱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>从你为了家人冲回火场起，从你选择和我一起留下，默默照顾雏鸟，承受孤独却从未真正抱怨的那一刻起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534704.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534704.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/da/HeadIconSmall-534704.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534704.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>不……甚至是从你降生的那一天起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>你就是我心中，最勇敢，也最令我骄傲的女儿。这份勇敢不需要任何人的认可。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>你永远不会让我失望。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>我……可是……我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>格林杜尔低低地鸣叫了一声，仿佛在附和多沃卡的肺腑之言。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>它抖了抖先前被网压塌的羽毛，悠悠站了起来，庞大的身躯带起一阵风。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>格林杜尔！你还有伤，不能……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“阿德琳。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314623.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314623.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>……欸？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314623.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314623.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1f/HeadIconSmall-314623.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314623.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>你……你能说话了？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_at_33.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_at_33\"><img alt=\"3_7_at_33\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-3_7_at_33.png/600px-Cg-3_7_at_33.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-3_7_at_33.png/900px-Cg-3_7_at_33.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/ba/Cg-3_7_at_33.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_at_33.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>世界的声音仿佛骤然远去。故园的风，母亲的呼吸，谷地树林间的摩挲……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她只看见了自己。透过尘酿鹰那双黄金般的巨大眼瞳，她看见了自己——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>面露惊愕，眼中蓄着未落的泪水。那个影像如此清晰，又如此陌生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>声音响起了。不是通过耳朵，而是直接在她脑海深处响起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>“你向书本中的神秘术寻求答案，从未倾听自己的心跳……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的呼吸停住了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>“我和多沃卡……在等你……看见自己……”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这不是责备，而是一声等待了太久的叹息。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>有什么东西在她体内断裂。困住自己的枷锁，蒙住心眼的厚茧，被从内部生长的光芒悄然顶破。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>契约。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>是“那个晚上”，为了命令对方丢下自己而生效的契约。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>呜……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_7_at_32.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_7_at_32\"><img alt=\"3_7_at_32\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-3_7_at_32.png/600px-Cg-3_7_at_32.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-3_7_at_32.png/900px-Cg-3_7_at_32.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2f/Cg-3_7_at_32.png/1200px-Cg-3_7_at_32.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">呜哇——</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>泪水汹涌地夺眶而出。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这是仅为了她自己而流的泪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>为那个在火光中茫然无措的阿德琳，为对着水面孤独练习神秘术的阿德琳，为那个背负着“我不够好”的包裹，跌跌撞撞走到今天的阿德琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>妈、妈妈……呜呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>对不起……呜……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>这有什么好对不起的呢，妈妈的“小瑞安侬”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534703.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534703.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-534703.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534703.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>看来，你已经承认和格林杜尔之间的契约了。终于可以外出远行了，别哭啦，这意味着你已经是个大孩子了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">阿德琳：</div><div>不去了……呜……我哪儿也不去了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>十二岁的你，答案是留下。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>你放弃了广阔的天空，让自己变成了一片坚实的大地。世界上绝大多数人都做不出这样的选择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>但现在，十六岁的缇威尔也不再远游了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>未知的精彩和眼前的幸福……总是非常让人难以抉择。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>以前，我不知道自己会不会去，会去多远，会去多久。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\"><img alt=\"2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/600px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/900px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png/1200px-Cg-2_1_bg_lvguanqiantai.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她抬起头，眼睛格外明亮。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>但我现在已经在“外面”了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>我想去睡前故事里的那些地方看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的声音里没有犹豫，也没有宣告般的郑重，如同在陈述一件在心里生长已久的事情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>原来如此……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>天亮了，小瑞安侬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8a/HeadIconSmall-637901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">欧文夫人：</div><div>我就不再留你了，去做你想做的事吧。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>得到答案的欧文夫人送客很决绝，和她留小瑞安侬过夜时一样强势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小瑞安侬站在旅店外，远远地向“欧文夫人”挥了挥手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>再见，妈妈。我们会定期给你写信的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“欧文夫人”一怔，随后嘴角向上扬起。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"637913.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-637913.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-637913.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"637913.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-637913.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-637913.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/1/1d/HeadIconSmall-637913.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-637913.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">“欧文夫人”：</div><div>不愧是妈妈的小瑞安侬。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>“欧文夫人”的五官开始扭曲、变形，骨骼也像被重新拼合了一般。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最后，黑纱下露出了多沃卡冷艳的五官。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-534705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-534705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-534705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>如果你真的毫无防备地把家里那些事说给外人听，我就不得不把你带回去关起来了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"534705.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-534705.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-534705.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"534705.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-534705.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-534705.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/HeadIconSmall-534705.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-534705.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">多沃卡：</div><div>你是什么时候认出来的？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>小瑞安侬骄傲地晃了晃术杖，落在上面的小尘酿鹰们咕叽咕叽地叫了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314601.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314601.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/6e/HeadIconSmall-314601.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314601.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">小瑞安侬：</div><div>当然是最开始了，妈妈。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "成你本所是-08"}}